                "text": "Missing fact\n\nWhy: Some rules could not decide because the model does not state a fact (for example the transport of a relationship that crosses a boundary), or an attribute key is not recognised. This is information, not an error.\n\nFix: State the fact in the technology label or with $tags (see the attribute vocabulary in the README).\n\nClauses: no clause found\n\nc4-guardrails assesses what a design-time diagram declares against deterministic rules. It evidences gaps and proposes fixes; it is not a compliance certification and not legal advice.",
                "markdown": "**Missing fact**\n\nSome rules could not decide because the model does not state a fact \\(for example the transport of a relationship that crosses a boundary\\), or an attribute key is not recognised. This is information, not an error.\n\n**Proposed fix:** State the fact in the technology label or with $tags \\(see the attribute vocabulary in the README\\).\n\n**Clauses**\n\n- no clause found\n\n_c4-guardrails assesses what a design-time diagram declares against deterministic rules. It evidences gaps and proposes fixes; it is not a compliance certification and not legal advice._\n"
